## Shared Libraries (`libs/`)

Shared code consumed by all applications via NestJS monorepo path aliases (`@lib/*`).

### Database Library (`libs/database/`)

PostgreSQL integration using native `pg` driver. This is the canonical location for the database module:

- **src/database.module.ts** - Global database module
- **src/database.service.ts** - Connection pooling, queries, transactions, RLS context
- **src/database.config.ts** - Database configuration factory
- **src/database.constants.ts** - Injection tokens
- **src/database.schema.ts** - Joi schema for DB env vars
- **src/index.ts** - Public API exports

#### Base Repository (`libs/database/src/base/`)

- **base.repository.ts** - Abstract base repository class
- **repository.interface.ts** - Repository interface definitions
- **cursor-pagination.helper.ts** - Cursor-based pagination utilities

### Embedding Library (`libs/embedding/`)

OpenAI embedding and text chunking services:

- **src/embedding.module.ts** - Embedding module
- **src/embedding.service.ts** - OpenAI embedding API integration
- **src/embedding.config.ts** - Configuration factory
- **src/embedding.constants.ts** - Injection tokens
- **src/embedding.schema.ts** - Joi schema for embedding env vars
- **src/index.ts** - Public API exports
- **src/chunking/** - Text chunking services
  - **clause-chunker.service.ts** - Clause-level chunking for legal documents
  - **text-chunker.service.ts** - General text chunking
  - **token-counter.service.ts** - Token counting (tiktoken)
- **src/interfaces/** - Chunking and config interfaces

### Queue Library (`libs/queue/`)

BullMQ queue abstraction shared across producers (API) and consumers (workers):

- **src/queue.module.ts** - Queue module (registers queues with BullMQ)
- **src/queue-producer.service.ts** - Type-safe job dispatching
- **src/queue.config.ts** - Configuration factory
- **src/queue.constants.ts** - Queue name constants
- **src/queue-job-map.ts** - Queue-to-job-type mapping
- **src/abstract-processor.ts** - Base class for BullMQ processors
- **src/index.ts** - Public API exports
- **src/interfaces/** - Job payload interfaces
  - **ai-processing.jobs.ts** - AI worker job payloads
  - **data-ingestion.jobs.ts** - Ingestion worker job payloads
  - **entitlement-processing.jobs.ts** - Entitlement async job payloads
  - **queue-config.interface.ts** - Queue configuration interface

### Redis Library (`libs/redis/`)

Redis connection management (ioredis):

- **src/redis.module.ts** - Redis module
- **src/redis.service.ts** - Redis client wrapper
- **src/redis.health.ts** - Redis health indicator
- **src/redis.config.ts** - Configuration factory
- **src/redis.constants.ts** - Injection tokens
- **src/redis.schema.ts** - Joi schema for Redis env vars
- **src/index.ts** - Public API exports
- **src/interfaces/** - Redis config interface

### Storage Library (`libs/storage/`)

S3 client factory and basic S3 operations shared across API and workers:

- **src/storage.module.ts** - Global module providing S3Client via DI
- **src/s3.service.ts** - Basic S3 operations (copy, head, get, delete, bucket management)
- **src/storage.config.ts** - Config factory (`storage.s3.*`, `storage.buckets.*`)
- **src/storage.schema.ts** - Joi env var schema for S3 variables
- **src/storage.constants.ts** - Injection tokens (`S3_CLIENT`)
- **src/index.ts** - Public API exports
- **src/interfaces/s3-config.interface.ts** - S3Config, StorageBucketsConfig, HeadObjectResult, CopyObjectResult

