### Feature Modules (`apps/api/src/modules/`)

**20 modules total:** auth, audit, authorities, categories, documents, email, entitlements, health, invitations, mock, platform-rbac, rag-mock, rulesets, storage, stripe, subscriptions, tenant-rbac, tenants, templates, users

#### Email (`email/`)

Transactional email delivery via AWS SES:

- **email.module.ts** - Module configuration
- **email.service.ts** - SES (`SendEmail`), verification, password reset, and billing-related templates
- **constants/i18n.constants.ts** - Email i18n keys

Used by AuthModule for signup verification and forgot-password flows. Fire-and-forget sending with graceful degradation (logs errors, never fails parent operation).

